    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 2c930c38b4efd35ab8c0adcb7c13348f68bf5ddd -->\n**Delta re-check (read-only, not rebuilt): ready for the maintainer to merge.**\n\nThis is a read-only check of the merge of main at 2c930c38 (since the reviewed head 4f302947). The build and test figures are the merge author's (23c62044 gate: `cargo check -p camcraft-app --all-targets` clean, `import` 26/26, `--lib geometry::import` 16/16); I did not rebuild.\n\n- Delta commits: 2c930c38 is the only PR-authored commit since 4f302947. Its second parent 23c62044 is main (#1079) and its other commits are already on main. Nothing else was changed by hand.\n- Merge hunk: the only conflict is the module list in `crates/app/src/geometry/import/mod.rs`. Both `mod step_diag;` (line 11) and `pub mod step_depth;` (line 12) are declared.\n- Nothing dropped: `git diff 23c6204 2c930c38` shows only additions. The #1079 depth check still runs first, at `step.rs:87` (`super::step_depth::check(data)?`), before `ruststep::parser::parse` at line 93. This PR's `step_diag::locate` wiring still wraps the parse error at `step.rs:93-99`.\n- Scope: `origin/main...2c930c38` is the PR's own 6 files (mod.rs, step.rs, step_diag.rs, tests/import.rs, a decision file, one testdata fixture). No snapshot PNG, no process file, no Cargo.toml change.\n- `mergeable`: MERGEABLE.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
